CandleDrill synthetic practice samples
======================================

Synthetic practice only. Not index-licensed.

These bars are generated by a seeded model. They are not exchange data, not
CME data, and not Nasdaq data. They are not a replay of any data vendor.

This project is not affiliated with CME, Nasdaq, any futures exchange, any
index provider, or any commercial data vendor.

Do not use these files for live trading, for research claims about real
markets, or as a substitute for licensed market data. Simulated results do
not predict real trading results.

The public pack id is SYNTH-TECHIDX-24H. When importing into CandleDrill, use
the symbol PRACTICE-TECHIDX-24H. CandleDrill reserves the SYNTH- prefix for
its built-in generator.

The calendar is a near-24h session-like window (Sun–Thu 18:00→17:00 local,
hour 17 empty) with a hand-tuned intraday volume shape. The price level and
calendar are independent of any listed contract.

